# "A Mountain or Forest card" is by subtype: a Plains is not offered (the refusal), Elegant Parlor (a Mountain Plains) is, and it enters
# tapped and surveils 1 even though the fetch puts it onto the battlefield. One life is paid (19) and the Foothills are sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Wooded Foothills
Island x6
Plains
Elegant Parlor
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Wooded Foothills.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Wooded Foothills.Activate
! Bot1.Search(Plains)
Bot1.Search(Elegant Parlor)
Bot1.Arrange(| Island)

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Battlefield = Elegant Parlor
Bot1.Battlefield.Elegant Parlor.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Island; Wooded Foothills
